		"bio": "<p>Pequeña Cretina aka Alexandra Martinez has been deejaying for decades. She is the award winning author of two poetry collections and runs Galaxy Pies, a small batch bakeshop located in Joshua Tree, CA.</p>",
		"socials": "<p>IG: alxndramartinez, Book Reviews and More: alexandramartinez.substack.com</p>",
		"showTitle": "Pequeña Cretina",
		"showDescription": "Pequeña Cretina is an ever-evolving experiment in sound centered around music but also interviews with authors and artists. Sometimes there's poetry readings, sometimes there's advice, sometimes there's just people screaming, tune in.",
